WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.950
Research-led positioning has four steps.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.929
Plot the facts,

00:00:03.979 --> 00:00:05.073
write the positioning,

00:00:05.123 --> 00:00:06.334
back it with proof points,

00:00:06.384 --> 00:00:08.458
then repeat a single message.

00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:13.633
UNICEF's research found most people didn't know it was a hundred percent donor funded.

00:00:13.683 --> 00:00:15.567
Hearing that lifted opinion.

00:00:15.617 --> 00:00:18.997
Little known, big lift: back that fact.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:20.500
So the proof points went on air:

00:00:19.924 --> 00:00:23.235
there in over a hundred and ninety countries,

00:00:23.285 --> 00:00:25.004
help within forty-eight hours.

00:00:25.054 --> 00:00:27.586
One message: Always there.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:33.682
So research, position, prove, then say one thing again and again.
